  unitName: Leo Whitefang (Omni)
  unitId: 850388
  unitNumber: 8356
  description: A proud king from a faraway land, his intellect and cunning in battle
    are legendary in their own right. His newfound adventures led him to add more
    entries to his dictionary for familiar words that he had rediscovered, such as
    "Fallen Gods" and "Summoners." Such marvels! Such wonders! He privately contemplated
    the fate of his own kingdom if matters were to be the same. Magic, after all,
    was an uncertain thing. Of course, the wandering king had to get home first,
    and that would be another story in itself...
  summonDesc: 'There is only one entry in my dictionary for "defeat": the fate of
    those who fight me!'
  fusionDesc: Let me see...hmm. I don't have an entry in my dictionary for this "Fusion"
    that you speak of. Yet.
  evoDesc: You may live forever, but what of your name? Instead, telling stories
    of my majesty would be better!
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
